; LondonRangeBreakout - example preset for 5-digit EURUSD (research only, NO performance implied)
; Differences from the gold preset: 20 points = 2.0 pips buffer; range filters 0.10-0.60 % of price
; (a 30-pip Asian range is ~0.28 % at 1.08); spread cap 15 points = 1.5 pips; SL cap 0.50 %.
; Hours are BROKER SERVER TIME; see README section 4 before trusting the defaults.
; Note: the only independent EUR/USD London-breakout test found in the research notes was a net loser.
; Format: Name=value||start||step||stop||Y/N  (Y = pre-flagged for optimization; ignored in single tests)
RangeStartHour=0||0||1||23||N
RangeStartMinute=0||0||5||55||N
RangeEndHour=7||5||1||10||N
RangeEndMinute=0||0||5||55||N
RangeSource=0||0||0||1||N
MinRangeBars=30||30||10||120||N
UseServerTime=true||false||0||true||N
ServerToUTCOffsetHours=2||2||1||3||N
TradeStartHour=7||7||1||10||N
TradeEndHour=10||9||1||12||N
ForceCloseHour=12||11||1||22||N
OneTradePerDay=true||false||0||true||N
MaxTradesPerDay=2||1||1||3||N
EntryMode=0||0||0||1||N
BufferPoints=20||0||10||100||Y
CancelOppositeOnFill=true||false||0||true||N
BreakoutATRMult=0.15||0.05||0.05||0.5||N
ATRPeriod=14||7||7||28||N
MinRangePctOfPrice=0.1||0.05||0.05||0.3||Y
MaxRangePctOfPrice=0.6||0.3||0.1||1.0||Y
MinRangePoints=0||0||50||500||N
MaxRangePoints=0||0||100||2000||N
SLMode=0||0||0||1||N
MaxSLPctOfPrice=0.5||0.2||0.1||1.0||N
SLATRMult=0.8||0.5||0.1||1.5||N
TakeProfitR=1.5||1.0||0.25||3.0||Y
MoveToBreakevenAtR=1.0||0.5||0.25||2.0||Y
BreakevenOffsetPoints=0||0||5||50||N
TrailATRMult=0.0||0.0||0.25||2.0||N
MaxSpreadPoints=15||5||5||40||N
NewsBlackoutWindows=
RiskPercent=1.0||0.25||0.25||2.0||N
FixedLots=0.0||0.0||0.01||1.0||N
SkipIfStopsLevelViolated=true||false||0||true||N
MagicNumber=20261106||20261106||1||20261106||N
DeviationPoints=20||10||10||100||N
TradeComment=LRB-EU
PrintVerbose=true||false||0||true||N
